block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">「碩士論文獎」（含在職專班）5篇，每篇獎金新台幣貳萬元整。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">「博士論文獎」2篇，每篇獎金新台幣參萬元整。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">「企業實務論文獎」5篇，每篇獎金新台幣參萬元整。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">每位得獎學生及其指導教授將各獲頒獎狀一紙、獎牌一座；企業實務組獲獎者獲頒獎狀一紙。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">【論文徵選範疇】</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">論文主題以企業永續(Corporate Sustainability, CS)及企業社會責任(Corporate Social Responsibility, CSR)相關議題為主，徵選範疇分為「環境」、「經濟」、「社會」及「綜合」四大面向。</span